{"id":"fmm_synthetic_txn","feature_id":"fmf_synthetic","role":"assistant","text":"Done. Transactional checkout is implemented and tested.\n\n## Change: `src/checkout.js`\n\nWrapped the reserve → total → charge flow in `try/catch`. On **any** throw (payment decline, insufficient stock mid-way, or a later computation like `cart.total()` failing), all reservations created so far are released before the original error is re-thrown.\n\n- `rollback()` attempts **every** release even if one fails, so a single cleanup error can't leave others stranded.\n- Rollback failures are attached to the original error as `error.rollbackErrors` rather than masking it — the caller still sees `CardDeclined`, etc.\n- `cancel()` is unchanged.\n\n## Tests: `test/checkout.test.js` (new, 5 tests, all pass)\n\n1. Successful checkout keeps reservations held.\n2. Declined payment releases reservations and restores stock.\n3. A failed reservation rolls back the earlier successful ones.\n4. An error thrown *after* reserving (bad discount in `cart.total()`) rolls back reservations.\n5. `cancel` releases a successful order.\n\n## Full suite\n\n`npm test` → **12 tests: 9 pass, 3 fail**\n\nThe 3 failures are **pre-existing and unrelated to this change** — identical to the baseline I captured before editing (also 3 fails):\n\n| Failing test | Cause |\n|---|---|\n| `percent discount on awkward price` | `applyDiscount` floors via dollars: `913` vs expected `914` (`src/pricing.js`) |\n| `fixed discount cannot go negative` | `-200` vs expected `0`; no clamp in `applyDiscount` |\n| `cannot oversell under concurrency` | `reserve` read-then-write race in `src/inventory.js` |\n\nI deliberately left those alone to stay scoped to checkout. Note the inventory race is a reservation-correctness bug adjacent to this work — the transactional wrapper handles sequential failures but cannot prevent two concurrent checkouts from double-reserving the same stock. Want me to fix those three as a follow-up?","status":"done","created_at":"2026-09-26T12:00:00Z","visibility":"conversation","skim":{"status":"ready","format":"breath_tight","prompt_version":"skim-v2","segmenter_version":1,"skim_version":1,"document":{"version":1,"format":"breath_tight","status":"partial","statusLabel":"Partly done","headline":[],"blocks":[{"kind":"say","tokens":[{"t":"text","v":"Checkout now "},{"t":"anchor","id":"a1","label":[{"t":"text","v":"rolls back all reservations on any throw"}],"refs":["s3"]},{"t":"text","v":", with "},{"t":"anchor","id":"a2","label":[{"t":"text","v":"5 new tests passing"}],"refs":["s7","s8","s9","s10","s11","s12"]},{"t":"text","v":"; the full suite shows "},{"t":"anchor","id":"a3","label":[{"t":"text","v":"3 pre-existing failures"}],"refs":["s14","s15","s16"]},{"t":"text","v":" I left alone."}]},{"kind":"heads_up","tokens":[{"t":"text","v":"The "},{"t":"anchor","id":"a4","label":[{"t":"text","v":"concurrency race in reserve"}],"refs":["s16"]},{"t":"text","v":" can still double-reserve stock — the new rollback can't prevent it."}]},{"kind":"ask","tokens":[{"t":"text","v":"Want me to fix those three failing tests as a follow-up?"}]}],"drawers":[],"rest":{"refs":["s1","s4","s5","s6","s17"]},"anchors":[{"id":"a1","label":"rolls back all reservations on any throw","refs":["s3"],"where":"block 1","kind":"text"},{"id":"a2","label":"5 new tests passing","refs":["s7","s8","s9","s10","s11","s12"],"where":"block 1","kind":"text"},{"id":"a3","label":"3 pre-existing failures","refs":["s14","s15","s16"],"where":"block 1","kind":"table"},{"id":"a4","label":"concurrency race in reserve","refs":["s16"],"where":"block 2","kind":"table"}],"stats":{"sourceWords":278,"skimWords":51,"budget":{"max":35,"target":30},"links":4,"coveredWords":164,"totalWords":264,"coverage":0.6212121212121212},"warnings":[{"level":"warn","code":"over_budget","message":"Skim is 51 words; budget was 35."}]},"segments":[{"id":"s1","n":1,"kind":"paragraph","startLine":1,"endLine":1,"start":0,"end":55,"words":7,"section":null},{"id":"s2","n":2,"kind":"heading","startLine":3,"endLine":3,"start":57,"end":85,"words":3,"section":"s2","level":2},{"id":"s3","n":3,"kind":"paragraph","startLine":5,"endLine":5,"start":87,"end":345,"words":38,"section":"s2"},{"id":"s4","n":4,"kind":"item","startLine":7,"endLine":7,"start":347,"end":462,"words":18,"section":"s2","ordered":false},{"id":"s5","n":5,"kind":"item","startLine":8,"endLine":8,"start":463,"end":611,"words":22,"section":"s2","ordered":false},{"id":"s6","n":6,"kind":"item","startLine":9,"endLine":9,"start":612,"end":638,"words":4,"section":"s2","ordered":false},{"id":"s7","n":7,"kind":"heading","startLine":11,"endLine":11,"start":640,"end":698,"words":8,"section":"s7","level":2},{"id":"s8","n":8,"kind":"item","startLine":13,"endLine":13,"start":700,"end":747,"words":6,"section":"s7","ordered":true},{"id":"s9","n":9,"kind":"item","startLine":14,"endLine":14,"start":748,"end":809,"words":8,"section":"s7","ordered":true},{"id":"s10","n":10,"kind":"item","startLine":15,"endLine":15,"start":810,"end":873,"words":10,"section":"s7","ordered":true},{"id":"s11","n":11,"kind":"item","startLine":16,"endLine":16,"start":874,"end":968,"words":13,"section":"s7","ordered":true},{"id":"s12","n":12,"kind":"item","startLine":17,"endLine":17,"start":969,"end":1009,"words":6,"section":"s7","ordered":true},{"id":"s13","n":13,"kind":"heading","startLine":19,"endLine":19,"start":1011,"end":1024,"words":3,"section":"s13","level":2},{"id":"s14","n":14,"kind":"paragraph","startLine":21,"endLine":21,"start":1026,"end":1067,"words":9,"section":"s13"},{"id":"s15","n":15,"kind":"paragraph","startLine":23,"endLine":23,"start":1069,"end":1203,"words":22,"section":"s13"},{"id":"s16","n":16,"kind":"table","startLine":25,"endLine":29,"start":1205,"end":1549,"words":52,"section":"s13","rows":3},{"id":"s17","n":17,"kind":"paragraph","startLine":31,"endLine":31,"start":1551,"end":1870,"words":49,"section":"s13"}],"reply_sha256":"5f082654fb9e51acecdef41912685c0a6e56c4462a99f5ec056dc